        <mxCell id="Kz5jj_GifknlN1pNBJkx-6" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 100px;&quot;&gt;Investements Advice UI&amp;nbsp; (general concepts and existing algorithims) , no AI is envolved , because it&#39;s not coidential&amp;nbsp; and not trained to generate an real allocation advice, there exist financial frameworks for this purpose such as MPT, other advice like goal advice and protection advice need other frameworks&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
