        <mxCell id="Kz5jj_GifknlN1pNBJkx-25" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 100px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff0000&quot;&gt;Common compaines that have implmented and offered a robo advisors services, We must look for something that they did not Implement, otherwise we would be olving an problem that is already solved by others !,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 255);&quot;&gt;ideas&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;described here are not new ; they are already implmented, we must built on top of them , first we build the base case (the bare minimum, then we should add one new service&amp;nbsp; that was not implmented by any APP )&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
